# Copy to .repo-kit/personal-tokens.txt (gitignored) and list your own values.
# One token per line; lines starting with # are comments.
# "token -> <placeholder>" splits on the first "->"; without one the default is <redacted>.
# Matching is whole-word and case-insensitive; other characters are taken literally.
# Private IPs and emails are detected automatically; list public IPs or hostnames here.
#
# your-first-name -> <your-name>
# your-login -> <your-user-name>
# your-laptop-hostname -> <computer-name>
# your-street-name -> <address>
